WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.428
Owen and Freya Leslie have just
had their annual review.

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:09.373
They've left behind a handwritten fact
find, photos of their passports and

00:00:09.443 --> 00:00:13.379
payslips, a pension statement, a
spreadsheet of their properties,

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.689
and 90 minutes of conversation.

00:00:16.293 --> 00:00:18.499
Now someone types it all into the CRM.

00:00:19.021 --> 00:00:23.468
Tab by tab, field by field, ticking one
box just to unlock the next.

00:00:24.072 --> 00:00:26.777
For one couple, that can be
over 100 entries.

00:00:27.102 --> 00:00:29.586
And the firm does it 156 times a year.

00:00:30.108 --> 00:00:33.580
One slip, and £500,000 becomes £500,

00:00:33.731 --> 00:00:34.950
in a regulated record.

00:00:35.693 --> 00:00:37.829
This is Fact Find Writer.

00:00:38.282 --> 00:00:40.465
Put it all in, however it arrived.

00:00:40.848 --> 00:00:44.377
Handwriting, photos,
spreadsheets, the transcript,

00:00:44.563 --> 00:00:46.768
and the adviser's voice note
from the car park.

00:00:47.291 --> 00:00:50.066
It reads everything at once, and
about a minute later,

00:00:50.344 --> 00:00:54.907
the update is ready. Not one field,
but the whole fact find,

00:00:55.058 --> 00:00:59.679
from income and property to pensions,
protection and the children.

00:01:00.201 --> 00:01:02.767
112 changes, ready to check.

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:04.949
It follows the conversation, too.

00:01:05.553 --> 00:01:09.292
Owen said £80,000, then corrected
himself to £65,000,

00:01:09.617 --> 00:01:10.929
so it takes £65,000.

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:15.166
Where the form and the meeting
disagree, it shows you both.

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:18.371
Figures from the voice note
always get a second look.

00:01:18.754 --> 00:01:19.880
And it never guesses.

00:01:20.484 --> 00:01:23.677
Owen mentioned an old workplace
pension, but not the value,

00:01:23.955 --> 00:01:25.256
so it waits for the number.

00:01:25.859 --> 00:01:29.540
For existing clients, what's on file
sits beside what's new.

00:01:30.143 --> 00:01:32.674
New clients are created and
linked as a couple.

00:01:33.196 --> 00:01:36.575
Check the summary, approve, and
it's written to the CRM.

00:01:37.271 --> 00:01:41.277
So after every meeting, there's a
complete, current client record,

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:45.073
from everything the client brought
in, and nobody typed it.

00:01:45.677 --> 00:01:49.264
Across 156 fact finds, that's around 110

00:01:49.299 --> 00:01:51.853
hours a year back. The meeting ends.

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:53.769
The typing never starts.
